🌍 REAL WORLD SYSTEM DESIGN USE
===========================================

👉 Cassandra → write-heavy apps
👉 RocksDB → storage engines
👉 Bigtable → Google infra
👉 Kafka (log structured concept)

---------------------------------

📌 WHERE LSM SHINES:
---------------------------------
✔️ Logging systems
✔️ Analytics pipelines
✔️ High write throughput systems

❌ Avoid when:
👉 Heavy range queries
👉 Low latency reads critical


